  "content": "<h3><img src=\"https://coolsimulations.net/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/infinitywaterbucket_logo_HD.png\" alt=\"无限水源桶\" width=\"1024\" height=\"512\"></h3>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>无限水源桶概述：</strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">无限水源桶是一个小型模组，允许在水桶上使用无限附魔，通过铁砧提供无限的便携式水源。它还允许您在水桶上使用无限附魔，提供无限的液体虚空。通过配置文件，您还可以为岩浆桶、牛奶桶和粉末雪桶（3.0.0+）进行附魔。</span></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>无限水源桶需求：</strong></span></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">无限水源桶可以使用<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\">Forge</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fprojects.neoforged.net%252fneoforged%252fneoforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a>或<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252fuse%252finstaller%252f\">Fabric</a>，甚至包括<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flegacyfabric.net%252fdownloads.html\">Legacy Fabric</a>。在Fabric（包括Legacy Fabric）上，Fabric API是可选的。<br></span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>主要功能：</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><br></strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">使用Mixin使无限附魔可以应用于空桶和水桶。<br></span>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">与发射器配合可放置无限水或拾取无限液体</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">防止附魔的空桶挤奶奶牛</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">防止附魔的物品拾取鱼类和鲵鱼</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">允许用无限数量填充/消耗坩埚</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">支持对以下内容进行附魔（需配置启用）</span>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">岩浆桶</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">牛奶桶</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">粉末雪桶</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">服务端运行，但缺少时客户端会出现视觉故障</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">内置更新检查器<br></span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">模组支持（已停止1.20+）</span>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/infinity-water-bucket/settings/https:/www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/caves-and-cliffs-backport\" rel=\"nofollow\">Caves and Cliffs Backport</a> - 阻止拾取鲵鱼及填充/清空坩埚<br></span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/milk-all-the-mobs/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Milk All The Mobs (Forge</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/milk-all-the-mobs-fabric/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric)</a> - 防止附魔空桶挤奶支持的实体</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/get-in-the-bucket-mod/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Get In The Bucket Mod</a> - 防止附魔物品拾取生物</span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">请注意此模组与 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/infinity-mending-unnerf\">Infinity Mending Unnerf</a> 不兼容</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://coolsimulations.net/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/InfinityWaterBucketPreview.gif\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\"></strong></span></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>Minecraft版本：</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">请勿要求将无限水源移植到旧版Minecraft。c0olsim会尽快开始更新无限水源到最新版本，请不要询问。<br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>许可与模组包：</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">请随意将无限水源桶用于任何模组包，同时确保给coolsim署名。不得以任何形式重新分发无限水源桶。</span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
